004","type":"noun","category":"business","indonesian":"ekspansi","chinese":"扩张/扩建","english":"expansion","ipa":"/ɛkˈspansi/","morphology":"荷兰语/英语借词: expansie → ekspansi (=扩张)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-25","next":"2026-07-26","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Ekspansi fase dua akan dimulai.","zhs":"二期扩张即将开始。"},{"ind":"Rencana ekspansi disetujui dewan.","zhs":"扩张计划获董事会批准。"},{"ind":"Ekspansi kapasitas 50%.","zhs":"产能扩张50%。"}]},{"id":"V3-D25-005","type":"noun","category":"business","indonesian":"kerja sama","chinese":"合作","english":"cooperation","ipa":"/ˈkɛrʤa ˈsama/","morphology":"kerja (=工作) + sama (=一起) → kerja sama (=合作,固定搭配)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-25","next":"2026-07-26","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Kerja sama kami berlangsung lama.","zhs":"我们的合作持续了很久。"},{"ind":"Kami berharap kerja sama lebih erat.","zhs":"我们希望更紧密的合作。"},{"ind":"Kerja sama investasi dimulai 2020.","zhs":"投资合作始于2020年。"}]},{"id":"V3-D25-006","type":"noun","category":"business","indonesian":"kunjungan","chinese":"考察/访问","english":"visit","ipa":"/kunˈjuŋan/","morphology":"词根: kunjung (=访问) + 后缀 -an → kunjungan (=访问/考察,名词化)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-25","next":"2026-07-26","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Kunjungan ke smelter sangat mengesankan.","zhs":"对冶炼厂的考察令人印象深刻。"},{"ind":"Kami mengatur kunjungan lapangan.","zhs":"我们安排现场考察。"},{"ind":"Kunjungan ini untuk inspeksi teknis.","zhs":"此次考察用于技术检查。"}]},{"id":"V3-D25-007","type":"noun","category":"business","indonesian":"presentasi","chinese":"演示/汇报","english":"presentation","ipa":"/presenˈtasi/","morphology":"英语借词: presentation → presentasi (=演示/汇报)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-25","next":"2026-07-26","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Presentasi proyek sangat detail.","zhs":"项目汇报非常详细。"},{"ind":"Kami siapkan presentasi untuk investor.","zhs":"我们为投资者准备汇报。"},{"ind":"Presentasi mencakup data produksi.","zhs":"汇报包含产量数据。"}]},{"id":"V3-D25-008","type":"noun","category":"business","indonesian":"negosiasi","chinese":"谈判","english":"negotiation","ipa":"/neɡosiˈasi/","morphology":"英语借词: negotiation → negosiasi (=谈判)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-25","next":"2026-07-26","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Negosiasi harga sedang berlangsung.","zhs":"价格谈判正在进行。"},{"ind":"Hasil negosiasi memuaskan kedua pihak.","zhs":"谈判结果令双方满意。"},{"ind":"Negosiasi kontrak butuh waktu.","zhs":"合同谈判需要时间。"}]},{"id":"V3-D25-009","type":"noun","category":"business","indonesian":"kesepakatan","chinese":"协议/共识","english":"agreement","ipa":"/kəsaˈpakan/","morphology":"词根: sepakat (=同意) + 前缀 ke- + 后缀 -an → kesepakatan (=协议)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-25","next":"2026-07-26","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Kesepakatan kerja sama telah ditandatangani.","zhs":"合作协议已签署。"},{"ind":"Kami mencapai kesepakatan baru.","zhs":"我们达成了新协议。"},{"ind":"Kesepakatan ini menguntungkan kedua pihak.","zhs":"此协议对双方有利。"}]},{"id":"V3-D25-010","type":"noun","category":"business","indonesian":"jadwal","chinese":"时间表/日程","english":"schedule","ipa":"/ˈʤadwal/","morphology":"阿拉伯语借词: jadwal (=日程表/时间表,商务印尼语核心词)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-25","next":"2026-07-26","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Jadwal produksi sudah ditetapkan.","zhs":"生产时间表已确定。"},{"ind":"Kami sesuaikan jadwal dengan mitra.","zhs":"我们与伙伴协调日程。"},{"ind":"Jadwal pengiriman tepat waktu.","zhs":"发货日程准时。"}]}],"dialogues":[{"id":"V3-D25-D1","title":"Kunjungan ke Kawasan Industri (园区考察接待)","title_zhs":"园区考察接待","scene":"Seorang manajer Cina berkunjung ke kawasan industri nikel di Morowali. Pihak Indonesia menyambut dan memperkenalkan fasilitas.","scene_zhs":"一位中方经理到访莫罗瓦利镍产业园区。印尼方接待并介绍设施。","lines":[{"speaker":"Pemandu (印尼接待)","ind":"Selamat datang di Kawasan Industri Morowali, Pak! Kami sangat senang Anda bisa berkunjung hari ini.","zhs":"欢迎来到莫罗瓦利工业园区,先生!非常高兴您今天能来考察。","keywords":["berkunjung (=考察/访问)","senang (=高兴)"]},{"speaker":"Manajer Cina (中方经理)","ind":"Terima kasih atas sambutannya. Saya ingin melihat fasilitas smelter RKEF dan area dermaga.","zhs":"感谢接待。我想看看RKEF冶炼厂设施和码头区域。","keywords":["sambutan (=接待)","fasilitas (=设施)"]},{"speaker":"Pemandu","ind":"Baik, Pak. Kawasan kami memiliki 20 smelter RKEF dengan kapasitas total 2 juta ton per tahun.","zhs":"好的,先生。我们园区拥有20座RKEF冶炼厂,总产能200万吨/年。","keywords":["kawasan (=园区/区域)","total (=总计)"]},{"speaker":"Manajer Cina","ind":"Bagus sekali! Berapa jumlah karyawan di kawasan ini?","zhs":"非常好!这个园区有多少员工?","keywords":["karyawan (=员工)","jumlah (=数量)"]},{"speaker":"Pemandu","ind":"Sekitar 50 ribu karyawan, 80% merupakan tenaga kerja lokal dari Sulawesi Tengah.","zhs":"大约5万名员工,80%是来自中苏拉威西的本地劳动力。","keywords":["tenaga kerja (=劳动力)","lokal (=本地的)"]},{"speaker":"Manajer Cina","ind":"Saya terkesan dengan skala operasi ini. Apakah ada rencana ekspansi ke depan?","zhs":"运营规模令我印象深刻。未来有扩张计划吗?","keywords":["terkesan (=印象深刻)","ke depan (=未来/向前)"]},{"speaker":"Pemandu","ind":"Ya, Pak. Fase dua akan menambah 8 smelter dan 2 pabrik HPAL, mulai konstruksi tahun depan.","zhs":"是的,先生。二期将新增8座冶炼厂和2座HPAL工厂,明年开始建设。","keywords":["menambah (=增加)","konstruksi (=建设)"]}]},{"id":"V3-D25-D2","title":"Negosiasi Kapasitas Produksi (产能谈判)","title_zhs":"产能谈判","scene":"Dua pihak membahas kontrak pasokan ferronikel, termasuk volume, harga, dan jadwal pengiriman.","scene_zhs":"双方讨论镍铁供应合同,包括数量、价格和发货时间表。","lines":[{"speaker":"Pembeli (采购方)","ind":"Kami butuh pasokan 30 ribu ton ferronikel per tahun, kadar nikel minimal 10%.","zhs":"我们需要每年3万吨镍铁供应,镍含量最低10%。","keywords":["pasokan (=供应)","kadar (=含量/品位)"]},{"speaker":"Penjual (销售方)","ind":"Kapasitas kami mencukupi. Kami bisa supply 30 ribu ton, harga mengikuti pasar LME plus premium.","zhs":"我们的产能充足。可以供应3万吨,价格按LME市场价加升水。","keywords":["mencukupi (=充足)","premium (=升水)"]},{"speaker":"Pembeli","ind":"Bisa diskon untuk kontrak jangka panjang tiga tahun?","zhs":"三年长期合同能给折扣吗?","keywords":["diskon (=折扣)","jangka panjang (=长期)"]},{"speaker":"Penjual","ind":"Untuk kontrak 3 tahun, kami berikan diskon 3% dari harga LME rata-rata kuartalan.","zhs":"对于3年合同,我们按LME季度均价给予3%折扣。","keywords":["rata-rata (=平均)","kuartalan (=季度的)"]},{"speaker":"Pembeli","ind":"Diterima. Jadwal pengiriman bagaimana?","zhs":"接受。发货时间表是怎样的?","keywords":[]},{"speaker":"Penjual","ind":"Pengiriman 2.500 ton per bulan, FOB dermaga Morowali, mulai Januari depan.","zhs":"每月发货2500吨,莫罗瓦利码头FOB,明年一月开始。","keywords":["pengiriman (=发货)","mulai (=开始)"]},{"speaker":"Pembeli","ind":"Sip. Kami siap tandatangan kontrak minggu depan.","zhs":"好。我们准备下周签合同。","keywords":["sip (=好的/行,口语)","tandatangan (=签署)"]}]}],"sentence_patterns":[{"id":"V3-D25-S1","pattern":"Selamat datang di [tempat]!","zhs":"欢迎来到[地点]!","usage":"接待开场白,用于任何正式场合","example":"Selamat datang di Kawasan Industri Morowali!"},{"id":"V3-D25-S2","pattern":"[Subjek] memiliki [jumlah] [fasilitas] dengan kapasitas [angka].","zhs":"[主体]拥有[数量][设施],产能为[数字]。","usage":"介绍设施规模和产能,商务汇报核心句型","example":"Kami memiliki 20 smelter dengan kapasitas 2 juta ton."},{"id":"V3-D25-S3","pattern":"Apakah ada rencana [kegiatan] ke depan?","zhs":"未来有[活动]计划吗?","usage":"询问未来计划/规划","example":"Apakah ada rencana ekspansi ke depan?"},{"id":"V3-D25-S4","pattern":"Kami butuh pasokan [jumlah] [barang] per [periode].","zhs":"我们需要每[周期][数量]的[货物]供应。","usage":"采购/谈判中表达需求量","example":"Kami butuh pasokan 30 ribu ton per tahun."},{"id":"V3-D25-S5","pattern":"[Subjek] berikan [diskon/potongan] [angka]% untuk [kondisi].","zhs":"[主体]对[条件]给予[数字]%的折扣/优惠。","usage":"商务谈判中提出价格条件","example":"Kami berikan diskon 3% untuk kontrak 3 tahun."}],"passages":[{"id":"V3-D25-P1","title":"Kebijakan Industri Nikel Indonesia","title_zhs":"印尼镍产业政策","duration":"~1 menit","lines":[{"ind":"Pemerintah Indonesia melarang ekspor bijih nikel mentah sejak tahun 2020.","zhs":"印尼政府自2020年起禁止原镍矿石出口。"},{"ind":"Kebijakan ini bertujuan mendorong hilirisasi industri nikel.","zhs":"该政策旨在推动镍产业下游化。"},{"ind":"Investor asing dan lokal membangun smelter di Indonesia.","zhs":"外国和本地投资者在印尼建设冶炼厂。"},{"ind":"Kawasan industri seperti IMIP dan IWIP berkembang pesat.","zhs":"IMIP和IWIP等工业园区快速发展。"},{"ind":"Indonesia ingin menjadi pusat produksi baterai listrik global.","zhs":"印尼希望成为全球电池生产中心。"},{"ind":"Kebijakan ini menciptakan lapangan kerja dan meningkatkan devisa.","zhs":"该政策创造就业机会并增加外汇。"},{"ind":"Tantangannya adalah kebutuhan energi dan isu lingkungan.","zhs":"挑战在于能源需求和环境问题。"}]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"V3-D25-Q1","question":"在接待对话中,园区有多少名员工?","options":["A. 约5万","B. 约1万","C. 约10万"],"answer":0},{"id":"V3-D25-Q2","question":"'Kerja sama' 的中文意思是?","options":["A. 工作","B. 合作","C. 同样"],"answer":1},{"id":"V3-D25-Q3","question":"谈判中提到的发货条件是什么?","options":["A. CIF Shanghai","B. FOB dermaga Morowali","C. DDP Jakarta"],"answer":1},{"id":"V3-D25-Q4","question":"'Negosiasi' 对应的中文是?","options":["A. 通知","B. 谈判","C. 庆祝"],"answer":1},{"id":"V3-D25-Q5","question":"句型 'Apakah ada rencana [kegiatan] ke depan?' 用于什么场景?","options":["A. 询问过去","B. 询问未来计划","C. 表达感谢"],"answer":1}]},"2026-07-26":{"date":"2026-07-26","lesson_id":"V3-D26","topic":"aplikasi_industri_nikel","title":"Aplikasi Industri Nikel (镍产业高级应用)","level":"B1-L1","items":[{"id":"V3-D26-001","type":"noun","category":"advanced","indonesian":"keberlanjutan","chinese":"可持续性","english":"sustainability","ipa":"/kəberlanˈtutan/","morphology":"词根: lanjut (=继续) + 前缀 ke-ber- + 后缀 -an → keberlanjutan (=可持续性,ESG核心词汇)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-26","next":"2026-07-27","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Keberlanjutan adalah prioritas utama kami.","zhs":"可持续性是我们的首要优先。"},{"ind":"Kami berkomitmen pada keberlanjutan lingkungan.","zhs":"我们致力于环境可持续性。"},{"ind":"Program keberlanjutan meliputi energi bersih.","zhs":"可持续性计划包括清洁能源。"}]},{"id":"V3-D26-002","type":"noun","category":"advanced","indonesian":"diversifikasi","chinese":"多元化","english":"diversification","ipa":"/diversioniˈsi/","morphology":"英语借词: diversification → diversifikasi (=多元化)","ebbinghaus":{"learned":"2026-07-26","next":"2026-07-27","interval":0,"streak":0},"examples":[{"ind":"Diversifikasi produk meningkatkan daya saing.","zhs":"产品多元化增强竞争力。"}